This document will discuss few possible methods that might be use to train the prediction model.
1. Rule-Based Baseline (use historical average)
    The simplest one which might be highly considered when the onboarding needs to delivery the demo next week
    This is a non-machine learning method, that only require to allocate data into different catagory based on the historical data
    Cons is flexible 

2. KNN classifier
    Predict level by looking at similar past examples 
    Perhaps set k in the range 10 to 15 (initial idea)


3. Decision tree classifier
    A more advanced allocating method than baseline
    Might be easy to overfitting, since when we processing data , we mentioned we will not delate the special even data since it too many works
    for onboarding, and will apply L2 or L1 later.


4. Random Forest Regressor
    coming soon...

As a result, this project will more likely to use the first when time is hash, otherwise KNN will be choosen.